  eqcom $p |- ( A = B <-> B = A ) $=
    ( wceq id eqcomd impbii ) ABCZBACZGABGDEHBAHDEF $.

  ${
    eqcoms.1 $e |- ( A = B -> ph ) $.
    $( Inference applying commutative law for class equality to an antecedent.
