     Lammen, 24-Oct-2024.) $)
  eqtr2 $p |- ( ( A = B /\ A = C ) -> B = C ) $=
    ( wceq eqeq1 biimpa ) ABDACDBCDABCEF $.

  $( A transitive law for class equality.  (Contributed by NM, 20-May-2005.)
     (Proof shortened by Wolf Lammen, 24-Oct-2024.) $)
  eqtr3 $p |- ( ( A = C /\ B = C ) -> A = B ) $=
    ( wceq eqeq2 biimparc ) BCDABDACDBCAEF $.

  ${
    eqtri.1 $e |- A = B $.
    eqtri.2 $e |- B = C $.
