  ${
    3eqtr4i.1 $e |- A = B $.
    3eqtr4i.2 $e |- C = A $.
    3eqtr4i.3 $e |- D = B $.
    $( An inference from three chained equalities.  (Contributed by NM,
       26-May-1993.)  (Proof shortened by Andrew Salmon, 25-May-2011.) $)
    3eqtr4i $p |- C = D $=
      ( eqtr4i ) CADFDBAGEHH $.

    $( An inference from three chained equalities.  (Contributed by NM,
