      ( cv wcel wa cab crab nfcri nfan weq eleq1w df-rab anbi12d cbvabw 3eqtr4i
      ) CKELZAMZCNDKELZBMZDNACEOBDEOUEUGCDUDADDCEGPHQUFBCCDEFPIQCDRUDUFABCDESJU
      AUBACETBDETUC $.
    $( $j usage 'cbvrabw' avoids 'ax-10' 'ax-13'; $)
  $}

  ${
    $d x y $.
    nfrabw.1 $e |- F/ x ph $.
    nfrabw.2 $e |- F/_ x A $.
    $( A variable not free in a wff remains so in a restricted class
       abstraction.  Version of ~ nfrab with a disjoint variable condition,
       which does not require ~ ax-13 .  (Contributed by NM, 13-Oct-2003.)
       Avoid ~ ax-13 .  (Revised by GG, 10-Jan-2024.)  (Proof shortened by Wolf
