  $( *** Theorems using axioms ax-13 or axc11r: *** $)

  ${
    $d x z $.  $d y z $.  $d z A $.
    nfrab.1 $e |- F/ x ph $.
    nfrab.2 $e |- F/_ x A $.
    $( A variable not free in a wff remains so in a restricted class
