    ssneld $p |- ( ph -> ( -. C e. B -> -. C e. A ) ) $=
      ( wcel sseld con3d ) ADBFDCFABCDEGH $.

    ssneldd.2 $e |- ( ph -> -. C e. B ) $.
    $( If an element is not in a class, it is also not in a subclass of that
