  $( Equality theorem for the subclass relationship.  (Contributed by NM,
     31-May-1999.) $)
  sseq12 $p |- ( ( A = B /\ C = D ) -> ( A C_ C <-> B C_ D ) ) $=
    ( wceq wss sseq1 sseq2 sylan9bb ) ABEACFBCFCDEBDFABCGCDBHI $.

  ${
