       element yields the original set.  (Contributed by Alexander van der
       Vekens, 11-Jan-2018.)  (Revised by AV, 9-Nov-2020.)  (Revised by AV,
       17-Dec-2021.) $)
    elnelun $p |- ( E u. N ) = A $=
