    un0 $p |- ( A u. (/) ) = A $=
      ( vx c0 cv wcel wo noel biorfri bicomi uneqri ) BACABDZAEZLKCEZFMLKGHIJ
      $.

    $( The intersection of a class with the empty set is the empty set.  Dual
