       (Contributed by NM, 21-Jun-1993.) $)
    in0 $p |- ( A i^i (/) ) = (/) $=
      ( vx c0 cv wcel wa noel bianfi bicomi ineqri ) BACCBDZCEZKAEZLFLMKGHIJ $.
  $}

  $( The union of the empty set with a class is itself.  Commuted form of
