     NM, 17-May-1998.) $)
  unv $p |- ( A u. _V ) = _V $=
    ( cvv cun ssv ssun2 eqssi ) ABCZBGDBAEF $.

  ${
    $d A x $.
    $( The empty set is a subset of any class.  Dual of ~ ssv .  Part of
