  ${
    $d x A $.  $d x B $.
    $( Subclass relationship for power class.  (Contributed by NM,
       21-Jun-2009.) $)
    pwss $p |- ( ~P A C_ B <-> A. x ( x C_ A -> x e. B ) ) $=
      ( cpw wss cv wcel wi wal df-ss velpw imbi1i albii bitri ) BDZCEAFZOGZPCGZ
      HZAIPBEZRHZAIAOCJSUAAQTRABKLMN $.
