      UJUPGUIUOCUHUNDEUEUKJZUGUMABUQUFULUCUEUKUDNOFPQRUAACDGSBCEGSUB $.
  $}

  ${
    $d x z w $.  $d y z w $.  $d ph z w $.  $d ps z w $.
    $( Union of two ordered pair class abstractions.  (Contributed by NM,
       30-Sep-2002.) $)
